				1768,
				94
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Migrate domain from land.playform.cloud to editor.land and simplify lock handling across providers\n\nThis commit encompasses three major refactoring efforts across the Mountain codebase:\n\n1. Domain Migration: Replace all occurrences of `land.playform.cloud` with `editor.land` across documentation, configuration, DNS, TLS, scheme handlers, service registry, and test fixtures. This includes:\n   - README.md, Binary/README.md, and GitHub documentation files\n   - CertificateManager examples and documentation\n   - DNS zone records, forward allowlist, and resolution logic\n   - land:// scheme handler CORS origins and service registration\n   - ServiceRegistry examples and TLS_README.md\n   - Tauri CSP connect-src and homepage\n   - Entry point service registration (code.editor.land, api.editor.land)\n   - Certificate and service registry tests\n\n2. Lock Handling Simplification: Remove verbose `.map_err(CommonError::StateLockPoisoned)` error mapping from mutex/lock operations across 40+ provider files. The pattern:\n   ```rust\n   .lock().map_err(|e| CommonError::StateLockPoisoned { Context: e.to_string() })?\n   ```\n   is simplified to `.lock()` or `.lock().unwrap()` since lock poisoning is treated as a fatal invariant violation rather than a recoverable error. Affected providers include CommandProvider, ConfigurationProvider, DiagnosticProvider, DocumentProvider, FileWatcherProvider, KeybindingProvider, LanguageFeatureProvider, OutputProvider, SearchProvider, SCMProvider, StatusBarProvider, StorageProvider, TreeViewProvider, UserInterfaceProvider, WebviewProvider, WorkspaceProvider, and PathSecurity utility.\n\n3. WindServiceHandlers Dispatcher Refactor: Restructure IPC command dispatchers with:\n   - Updated import paths from `crate::Module` to `crate::IPC::WindServiceHandlers::Module`\n   - Runtime parameter changed from `&ApplicationRunTime` to `Arc<ApplicationRunTime>` for shared ownership\n   - New UICommandDispatcher.rs consolidating commands, extensions, and decorations handling\n   - Merge conflict resolution in ConfigurationDispatcher, LanguageDispatcher, SearchDispatcher, SkyDispatcher, TerminalDispatcher, WorkspaceDispatcher, and ReplayEvents\n\nAdditionally implements VineHost trait on MountainVinegRPCService with IPC provider, renderer emitter, command registry, SCM registration, language provider registration, and terminal management bridges.\n\nImpact: Unified domain branding, reduced boilerplate in state access patterns, and improved IPC dispatcher architecture for Effect-TS frontend integration.",
			"SHA": "bdf82d1cf0879fd098fc74f9f7ddeb17ba08f356"
		}
	],
